  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Norway&apos;s Cuba Programme 2020-2022, Year 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Caritas Norrway&apos;s Cuba Programme 2020-2022, Year 2 is a contiunation of the MFA/Embassy&apos;s work with Caritas from 2013. The objective of this project is to contribute to the reform efforts in Cuba by facilitating constructive dialogue between civil society and the government, and provide key youth leaders knowledge on democratic theory and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
